{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdKqaY6XZwzj2WxSfLUw4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan and spec read. Critically, the campaign rulings **R1 and R3 supersede the plan's mechanism**: the plan reuses `chrome.runtime.openOptionsPage()` at install, but R1 (paid-for debugging finding) rules that call creates no tab at cold `--load-extension` launch — I must use `chrome.tabs.create({ url: chrome.runtime.getURL('options.html') })` instead, and R3 puts `onboarding.spec.ts` in scope to fix the regression that swap causes.\n\nLet me verify the old branch is safely on remote before removing its stale worktree, and read the harness files."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15328,"cache_read_input_tokens":39000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15328},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1582a562-7cd7-4915-90db-f6e0a641a53f","uuid":"5fb61ed9-4b3e-467b-86e9-f45156abbbf7","timestamp":"2026-07-23T23:14:59.006Z","request_id":"req_011CdKqaVYV6qNetMKnRVfrq"}
