{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdKtLCgvve8cdRvm5ATYB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Same 3 fail deterministically in isolation — **not flakes, reproducible**. All three use `getServiceWorker` + `relayCommand` (the A4 command-relay path). My hypothesis: C1's install-created `options.html` tab is now the *active* tab, so a command that the SW relays to the active tab lands on `options.html` (no content script) instead of the test's fixture page. Let me confirm by reading `relayCommand` and how the target tab is chosen."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1835,"cache_read_input_tokens":122801,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1835},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1582a562-7cd7-4915-90db-f6e0a641a53f","uuid":"7b72a2f9-9d75-4216-b9b9-ff1778b6c32b","timestamp":"2026-07-23T23:50:33.925Z","request_id":"req_011CdKtLBKaigDdZuX91ZXyU"}
