{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MbVH71J9fTbDmeRFPJmz1c","type":"tool_result","content":"589:successful lookup (C10 is that proof harness). Real-user funnel telemetry is deliberately **not**\n597:**Sequencing the lead should follow:** C10 first (it is the proof harness the others' DoD cites),\n598:then C1 → C2 → C5 → C6 → C7 → C8 → C3 → C4 → C9 (→ C11).\n607:C11 makes the page install-aware, and several cards gain page touchpoints (noted per card).\n609:API key (S1) — key entry stays inside the extension's own pages. And the C10 funnel e2e must\n614:#### C1 — Open onboarding on install `Impact 5 · Effort S · Score 5.0` · **foundation**\n719:#### C10 — Deterministic funnel e2e `Impact 3 · Effort S · Score 3.0` · **proof harness**\n816:#### C11 — Install-aware landing page `Impact 3 · Effort S · Score 3.0` · **added 2026-07-16**\n833:- **Depends on:** — (richer with C1/C2 shipped) · **Lead decides:** marker shape, checklist UX.\n861:    C10[C10 Funnel e2e] -.proof harness for.-> C1[C1 Open on install]\n865:    LP -.adapts via.-> C11[C11 Install-aware landing]\n870:any order. In Category C, C10 goes first (it is the proof harness every other C-card's DoD cites),\n871:C3/C4 wait for C2; the rest are independent. C3 and C11 also touch `docs/index.html` (the landing\n899:| 1    | B1 Save word ·foundation ✅ Shipped | 5.0   | 12   | C10 Funnel e2e ·harness    | 3.0   |\n900:| 1    | C1 Open on install ·foundation      | 5.0   | 12   | C11 Install-aware landing  | 3.0   |\n1080:  with the key exported.** Category C's measured goal: 7 audited dead-ends → 0, proven by the C10\n1091:  before dispatch); C11 added (install-aware landing checklist; marker = install boolean +\n1092:  version only, landing origin only — anything richer is a §1 privacy escalation); C1 keeps the\n1094:  (S1) and setup must work offline; C4/C6/C8/C9 gain page touchpoints; C10's funnel e2e must","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01B9iSw7CJVDP18fuoG